<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>05 · DEPLOYMENT</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1D4ED8' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12275A', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            场景一｜智能客服：答复有出处，背景记得住
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>01</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 5 }}>客户提问</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        问题从企业微信、飞书或钉钉进入，与控制台共用同一条管线。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={26} height={18} viewBox='0 0 26 18'><path d='M0 9 L16 9' stroke='#1D4ED8' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M16 2 L26 9 L16 16 Z' fill='#1D4ED8' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, background: '#12275A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#7EA3D6', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>02</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 5 }}>知识库检索</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A9C2E8', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        在私有文档中检索相关片段，答案附带来源标记可回溯。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={26} height={18} viewBox='0 0 26 18'><path d='M0 9 L16 9' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M16 2 L26 9 L16 16 Z' fill='#06B6D4' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>03</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 5 }}>带出处作答</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        答案直接回传原会话，客户与坐席都能看到引用来源。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={26} height={18} viewBox='0 0 26 18'><path d='M0 9 L16 9' stroke='#F59E0B' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M16 2 L26 9 L16 16 Z' fill='#F59E0B' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, background: '#FFF7E9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#F5D9A4', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>04</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 5 }}>不知则转人工</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        缺信息时主动反问，超范围时升级人工并保留完整上下文。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={26} height={18} viewBox='0 0 26 18'><path d='M0 9 L16 9' stroke='#F59E0B' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M16 2 L26 9 L16 16 Z' fill='#F59E0B' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 212, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 13 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>05</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 5 }}>沉淀为记忆</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        本次结论进入长期记忆，下次不必重讲背景。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginTop: 22 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 15 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>减少来回切换</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        坐席不必在工单、知识库与聊天窗口之间跳转，答复与出处在同一处呈现。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 15 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>口径统一</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        答案来自同一份受控文档，避免不同坐席给出互相矛盾的说法。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 15 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>上下文延续</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        客户二次咨询时带着上次结论继续，不需要从头复述问题。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#12275A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 15 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>数据留在本地</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#D6E3F5', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        客户对话与语料都不出内网，便于通过合规审查。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, borderRadius: 2, background: '#1D4ED8' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#12275A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                客服场景的价值不在「回答得快」，而在「答得准、说得清出处、记得住前情」——三者缺一，客户体验都回不去。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
